(7, 267, '1785842937701', 'digital_marketing', 'monthly', '2026-08-07', '2026-09-07', '{\"cover_page\":{\"duration\":\"1 Month\",\"proposal_date\":\"4 August 2026\",\"proposal_validity\":\"7 Days\",\"prepared_by\":\"DOAGuru InfoSystems\",\"website\":\"www.doaguru.com\"},\"executive_summary\":\"This proposal outlines a comprehensive digital marketing strategy designed to strengthen Apollo Hospital\'s online presence, enhance patient trust, and drive sustainable growth. As patients increasingly rely on digital platforms to find healthcare providers, maintaining a strong and credible online presence has become essential.\\nOur approach combines strategic branding, engaging social media management, performance marketing, search engine optimization (SEO), website optimization, and data-driven analytics to improve visibility, increase patient engagement, and generate qualified patient inquiries. Every strategy is tailored to align with your hospital\'s goals while ensuring consistent brand communication across all digital channels.\\nAt DOAGuru Infosystems, we are committed to delivering measurable results through innovative marketing solutions, transparent reporting, and continuous optimization. Our objective is not only to increase your digital reach but also to build lasting patient relationships that contribute to the long-term success and growth of your healthcare organization.\",\"about_us\":\"DOAGuru Infosystems is a full-service digital marketing agency dedicated to helping businesses build a strong digital presence and achieve measurable growth. With 7+ years of industry experience, we specialize in Digital Marketing, Website Development, Branding, Creative Design, and Performance Marketing.\\nBacked by a team of 50+ professionals and 200+ successful projects, we combine creativity, technology, and data-driven strategies to deliver impactful marketing solutions. Our focus is on building long-term partnerships by delivering transparent communication, innovative ideas, and measurable business results.\",\"client_problem\":\"Apollo Hospital, Jabalpur has established itself as one of the region\'s trusted healthcare providers, offering advanced medical treatments supported by experienced specialists and modern healthcare infrastructure. With a strong reputation for clinical excellence, the hospital is well-positioned to further strengthen its leadership in the Mahakoshal region through strategic digital marketing.\\nBased on our assessment, Apollo Hospital maintains an active presence across digital platforms, creating a solid foundation for growth. However, there is a significant opportunity to elevate content quality, strengthen visual storytelling, and create more patient-centric, educational content that builds trust and engagement. Additionally, improving Google Business Profile SEO and local search visibility can help the hospital reach more patients actively searching for healthcare services.\\nA key opportunity lies in positioning Robotic Surgery as Apollo Hospital\'s flagship specialty. Through targeted content, patient awareness campaigns, doctor-led educational videos, and localized digital marketing, Apollo Hospital can strengthen brand awareness, educate the community, and attract high-intent patients seeking advanced surgical care across the Mahakoshal region.\",\"proposed_solution\":\"To help Apollo Hospital strengthen its digital presence and establish itself as the preferred destination for advanced healthcare in the Mahakoshal region, we propose a comprehensive digital marketing strategy focused on brand awareness, patient education, and sustainable growth.\\nOur approach will position Robotic Surgery as a flagship specialty through high-quality, patient-centric content, doctor-led educational videos, and targeted awareness campaigns that build trust and increase public awareness. Alongside this, we will enhance the hospital\'s overall digital presence by creating engaging social media content, improving local search visibility through Google Business Profile (GMB) SEO, and implementing a consistent content strategy that highlights Apollo Hospital\'s medical expertise, advanced technology, and patient success stories.\\nBy combining creative storytelling, data-driven marketing, and continuous optimization, our goal is to increase brand visibility, strengthen patient confidence, improve online engagement, and generate qualified patient inquiries, ultimately positioning Apollo Hospital as the first choice for advanced healthcare services across the Mahakoshal region.\",\"scope_of_work\":[],\"strategy_overview\":\"Our digital marketing strategy is built around four key pillars designed to strengthen Apollo Hospital\'s digital presence, enhance patient trust, and position Robotic Surgery as a leading healthcare service in the Mahakoshal region.\\n1. Brand Awareness\\nBuild a strong and consistent brand presence through high-quality social media content, educational campaigns, and impactful visual storytelling that highlights Apollo Hospital\'s expertise and healthcare excellence.\\n2. Patient Education\\nCreate informative doctor-led content, healthcare awareness campaigns, and treatment-focused videos to educate patients, build credibility, and encourage informed healthcare decisions.\\n3. Local Visibility\\nEnhance Google Business Profile (GMB) SEO and optimize local search presence to improve discoverability, attract nearby patients, and strengthen Apollo Hospital\'s visibility across the Mahakoshal region.\\n4. Patient Acquisition\\nLeverage performance-driven digital campaigns and strategic content marketing to generate qualified patient inquiries, with a dedicated focus on promoting Robotic Surgery as a flagship specialty.\",\"timeline\":[],\"expected_results\":\"Based on our experience with similar projects, we anticipate the following results:\\n\\nWithin 3 Months:\\n• [Result 1 with metric, e.g., 30% increase in organic traffic]\\n• [Result 2 with metric]\\n\\nWithin 6 Months:\\n• [Result 3 with metric]\\n• [Result 4 with metric]\\n\\nNote: These projections are based on industry benchmarks and past performance. Actual results may vary based on market conditions and implementation consistency.\",\"pricing_investment\":[],\"terms_conditions\":[],\"notes_selection\":[{\"id\":1785855909583,\"note_name\":\"All amounts need to be paid in advance. Only the ad budget will be paid upon request of the client or immediately after the service is started.\",\"type\":\"manual\"},{\"id\":1785855919756,\"note_name\":\"Please note that service charges are non-refundable but may be adjusted against another service.\",\"type\":\"manual\"},{\"id\":1785855927050,\"note_name\":\"One dedicated SPOC (single point of contact) is required from the client side to approve the posts, contents, videos changes, etc.\",\"type\":\"manual\"},{\"id\":1785855933652,\"note_name\":\"Required details like credentials and other details are needed to share timely.\",\"type\":\"manual\"},{\"id\":1785855953953,\"note_name\":\"SEO takes time (3-6 months to show results).\",\"type\":\"manual\"}],\"additional_remarks\":\"\",\"client_instructions\":\"\",\"why_choose_us\":\"At DOAGuru Infosystems, we don\'t just market businesses—we build digital growth strategies that deliver measurable results. Our approach combines creativity, data, and industry insights to help healthcare organizations strengthen their brand, connect with the right audience, and achieve sustainable growth.\\nWhy Partner with DOAGuru Infosystems?\\nHealthcare Marketing Expertise – Proven strategies designed to build patient trust and enhance hospital visibility.\\nResult-Oriented Approach – Every campaign is aligned with clear business objectives and measurable outcomes.\\nCreative & Educational Content – High-quality visuals and informative content that engage patients and strengthen credibility.\\nData-Driven Decision Making – Continuous performance monitoring and optimization to maximize marketing effectiveness.\\nTransparent Communication – Regular reporting, clear insights, and dedicated support throughout the partnership.\\nEnd-to-End Digital Solutions – From content creation and social media management to GMB SEO and performance marketing, we provide a complete digital growth ecosystem under one roof.\\nOur goal is to become a long-term digital growth partner, helping Apollo Hospital strengthen its online presence, increase patient engagement, and establish itself as the preferred healthcare destination across the Mahakoshal region.\",\"approval_acceptance\":{\"our_signatory_name\":\"\",\"our_signatory_designation\":\"\",\"client_signatory_name\":\"\",\"client_signatory_designation\":\"\",\"acceptance_date\":\"\"},\"pricing_discount\":{\"type\":\"Amount\",\"value\":200}}', '{\"client_problem\":true,\"strategy_overview\":true,\"timeline\":false,\"expected_results\":false,\"additional_remarks\":false,\"client_instructions\":false,\"why_choose_us\":true}', '[{\"id\":5,\"service\":\"Graphic Design - Banner Graphic\",\"service_name\":\"Graphic Design\",\"category_name\":\"Banner Graphic\",\"editing_type_name\":null,\"quantity\":\"6\",\"unit_price\":500,\"total_price\":3000,\"include_in_total\":true,\"source\":\"custom_graphic\"},{\"id\":6,\"service\":\"Video Services - Reels (Advance Editing)\",\"service_name\":\"Video Services\",\"category_name\":\"Reels\",\"editing_type_name\":\"Advance Editing\",\"quantity\":\"10\",\"unit_price\":2000,\"total_price\":20000,\"include_in_total\":true,\"source\":\"custom_graphic\"},{\"id\":7,\"service\":\"Video Services - Testimonial Reel (Basic Editing)\",\"service_name\":\"Video Services\",\"category_name\":\"Testimonial Reel\",\"editing_type_name\":\"Basic Editing\",\"quantity\":\"2\",\"unit_price\":1000,\"total_price\":2000,\"include_in_total\":true,\"source\":\"custom_graphic\"},{\"id\":8,\"service\":\"Video Services - YouTube Long Video (Standard Editing (2-3 mins))\",\"service_name\":\"Video Services\",\"category_name\":\